        "content": "What function calculates a hedge fund’s ending investor capital after independently applying an annual management fee to end-of-period assets and an incentive fee only on profits above a prior high-water mark, given the starting assets, fee rates, prior return, and pre-fee ending value? The function should support a “2 and 30” fee structure and return the ending capital in monetary units.",
