      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables in millions of dollars\n    current_value_before_fees = 320.0\n    management_fee_rate = 0.02\n    prior_year_aum = 350.0\n    prior_year_return = 0.20\n\n    # Calculate the high-water mark and fees\n    high_water_mark = prior_year_aum * (1 + prior_year_return)\n    management_fee = current_value_before_fees * management_fee_rate\n    incentive_fee = max(0.0, current_value_before_fees - high_water_mark) * 0.30\n\n    # Calculate ending capital\n    ending_capital = current_value_before_fees - management_fee - incentive_fee\n\n    return round(ending_capital, 1)\n```",
